#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq.rst:18 401cb4597e3d46749076ec77a1f79450
msgid "Base class for multi-band equalizer audio effects."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectEQ**    使用一个或多个 FMOD    ``MULTIBAND_EQ``    DSP 组成多段均衡器。它可以按预设创建 6、10 或 21 "
"个频段，也可以逐频段修改增益、中心频率、Q 值和滤波器类型。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq.rst:23 c3ced5203f4a49aa98af2bc6a0c221b6
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq.rst:25 e57d049b4298478fb80abcb534171550
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectEQ is a base class for multi-band equalizer audio effects using FMOD's "
"MULTIBAND_EQ DSP. It provides flexible frequency equalization with support for multiple bands, "
"each with independent gain, frequency, Q value, and filter type."
msgstr "FmodAudioEffectEQ 是基于 FMOD MULTIBAND_EQ DSP 的多频段均衡器基类。每个频段均可独立设置增益、频率、Q 值和滤波类型。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq.rst:27 629e9c843b454d4889322739426dfb54
msgid ""
"The effect supports three preset configurations: 6-band, 10-band, and 21-band equalizers. Each "
"band uses a peaking filter by default, but can be configured with other filter types including "
"low-pass, high-pass, low-shelf, high-shelf, and more."
msgstr "支持 6 段、10 段和 21 段配置。各频段默认使用峰值滤波器，也可配置为低通、高通、低架、高架等类型。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq.rst:29 1c8d713b29544e1db89fadec6ecdf4c8
msgid ""
"To apply this effect to an audio bus, use "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffect.apply_to()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_apply_to>` and pass a "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>`."
msgstr ""
"调用    :ref:`FmodAudioEffect.apply_to()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_apply_to>`    并传入    "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>`   ，将效果器应用到音频总线。"

